        "description": "This use case consists of a campaign that automatically sends a personalized email to customers who have left your e-store without a purchase but have viewed at least three items. Get a custom evaluation dashboard, a working automated scenario, and a prebuilt email template with a personalization block that shows the last three browsed products, all in one place. A common challenge for many marketers is to engage with the customer at the right point in their shopping journey. This use case focuses on customers who have looked at multiple products, but have not yet made a purchase.",
